    "Description": "Collector with the supported components for a Red Hat build of OpenTelemetry\n\nSecurity Fix(es):\n\n* net/http: golang.org/x/net/http2: golang: net/http: Denial of Service via HTTP/2 trailer header memory exhaustion (CVE-2026-78659)\n\n* net/http: golang: golang.org/x/net/http2: net/http: HTTP response smuggling via malformed HTTP/2 framing headers (CVE-2026-78660)\n\n* github.com/klauspost/compress/zstd: klauspost/compress: Denial of Service via crafted zstd compressed input (CVE-2026-116591)\n\nFor more details about the security issue(s), including the impact, a CVSS score, acknowledgments, and other related information, refer to the CVE page(s) listed in the References section.",
